  "description": {
    "en": "Kirschbaum Synthetic Gut Premium is a classic high-quality polyamide synthetic gut string designed to provide balanced comfort, power and durability for players of all levels. Its smooth round construction delivers predictable response and easy playability, making it suitable both as a full-bed string and as a softer hybrid partner. Kirschbaum specifically recommends pairing it with Pro Line Black or Pro Line Rough to combine comfort with polyester control and spin. The 1.25 mm version emphasizes feel and power, while the 1.30 mm version offers greater durability and stability.",

    "zh": "Kirschbaum Synthetic Gut Premium 是一款高品质经典聚酰胺合成肠线，面向各个水平的球员，在舒适性、力量和耐久性之间提供均衡表现。圆形光滑结构带来稳定、易驾驭的击球反馈，既可以整床使用，也非常适合作为 Hybrid 混穿中的柔和搭档。Kirschbaum 官方特别建议与 Pro Line Black 或 Pro Line Rough 搭配，以在舒适性的基础上获得聚酯线的控制和旋转。1.25毫米版本更强调手感和力量；1.30毫米版本则更偏向耐久与稳定。"
  },

